            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Chu, Mei Ling and Parigi, Paolo and Latombe, Jean-Claude and Law, Kincho. (2013). TR216: SAFEgress: A Flexible Platform to Study the Effect of Human and Social Behaviors on Egress Performance. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: http://purl.stanford.edu/tq804kf0988",
